<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Assistant Maths — v1.0</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/retro.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/chat.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/auth.css">
</head>
<body>
    <header class="site-banner">
        <h1>Assistant Maths</h1>
        <div class="site-tagline">Évaluateur de réponses &amp; base d'exercices</div>
    </header>

    <div class="layout">
        <aside class="sidebar">
            <div class="sidebar-title">Menu</div>
            <div class="sidebar-auth">
                {% include "_header.html.j2" %}
            </div>
            <nav class="sidebar-nav">
                <a href="/" class="active">💬 Chat</a>
                <a href="/exercises">📚 Exercices</a>
                <a href="/training">✏️ Entraînement</a>
                <a href="/settings">⚙️ Paramètres</a>
                <a href="/profile">👤 Profil</a>
            </nav>
        </aside>

        <main class="content">
            <div class="content-header">
                <h1>💬 Assistant Maths — Évaluateur de réponses</h1>
            </div>

            <div class="content-body">
                <div class="window" id="chat-window">
                    <div class="title-bar">
                        <h2 class="title-bar-text">💬 Évaluateur de réponses</h2>
                    </div>

                    <div class="window-body">
                        <div class="chat-messages" id="chat-messages">
                            <div class="message bot">
                                <div class="avatar">🤖</div>
                                <div class="bubble">
                                    <div class="msg-header">Assistant · <span class="msg-time">--:--</span></div>
                                    <p>Bonjour 👋 Donnez-moi un <strong>problème de maths</strong> et votre <strong>réponse</strong> : je les évaluerai et vous donnerai un feedback détaillé.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <form class="chat-input" id="chat-form" autocomplete="off">
                            <input type="text" id="problem-input" placeholder="Énoncé du problème..." aria-label="Problème">
                            <input type="text" id="answer-input" placeholder="Votre réponse..." aria-label="Réponse">
                            <button type="submit" class="send-btn">Envoyer ➤</button>
                        </form>
                    </div>

                    <div class="status-bar">
                        <span class="status-field">Prêt</span>
                        <span class="status-field" id="msg-count">0 évaluation(s)</span>
                        <span class="status-field">v1.0</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>
    </div>

    <script defer src="/static/js/auth.js"></script>
    <script src="/static/js/chat.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
